pan class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  Hi, Kristi!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>:  Hi, Adam!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  How is the job search going?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Oh, it's not easy.  By the end of the month, I will have had four different interviews. Everyone expects me to have a lot of experience. They ask a million questions. I just know I'm going to get nervous and lose control. I'll have to prepare better answers for my next interview.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Can you give me an example of a question you had problems with? That could help me.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I'd love to help. Questions about my experiences or education are fairly straightforward. I have a hard time when they describe a hypothetical situation and ask me how I would react. For example, once they asked me how I would deal with a journalist whom I suspected was plagiarizing. <br>", "id": 0}, {"time": "44300", "image": "engenn9le13ob05re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: What did you say?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I didn't know what to say. Could you help me prepare a good answer?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I can try.  You could try to find proof of plagiarism before you say anything. You can find a lot of things by doing internet searches. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Thanks, that sounds good. Speaking of interviews, how did yours go?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: It was a phone interview!  Can you believe it? All that time I spent worrying about a tie was for nothing.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Why a phone interview?<br>", "id": 1}, {"time": "70000", "image": "engenn9le13ob05re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I don't know. They said I could be invited to meet them for a second interview.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: How did it go?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Not bad, but not great. I'll need to prepare better answers for next time. I'm going to have to decide which articles I'm most proud of. Can you help me?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>:  Sure I can. I'll read your articles again tonight.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Thanks. I'm calling her next week to ask for a follow-up. I'll be thinking about what to say all week.<br>", "id": 2}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}